"Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment | California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://www.selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/jcc-form/MC-013-INFO)\nciteturn1787search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; # Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment (MC-013-INFO) ... Effective: January 1, 2026\n\n# Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment (MC-013-INFO)\n\nExplains what a judgment creditor (a person the court has decided is owed money by another party in a civil case) has a right to collect from the other party and how to figure out the interest and the amount that a judgment creditor is owed.\n\nGet form MC-013-INFO\n\nEffective: January 1, 2026--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=1&query=civil)\nciteturn1787search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday;   * MC-013-INFO Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment Effective: January 1, 2026\nSee form info Download\n\n  * MC-012 * Memorandum of Costs After Judgment, Acknowledgement of Credit, and Declaration of Accrued Interest Effective: January 1, 2026\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * MC-013-INFO Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment Effective: January 1, 2026\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * MC-050 * Substitution of Attorney—Civil (Without Court Order) Effective: January 1, 2009\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * MC-051 * Notice of Motion and Motion to Be Relieved as Counsel—Civil Effective: January 1, 2007\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * MC-052 * Declaration in Support of Attorney's Motion to Be Relieved as Counsel—Civil Effective: January 1, 2007\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * MC-053 * Order Granting Attorney's Motion to Be Relieved as Counsel—Civil Effective: January 1, 2007\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * MC-125 * Confidential Information Form Under Civil Code Section 1708.85 or 1708.89 Effective: January 1, 2026\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * POS-015 * Notice and Acknowledgment of Receipt—Civil Effective: January 1, 2005\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * POS-020 Proof of Personal Service—Civil (Proof of Service) / Information Sheet for Proof of Personal Service—Civil Effective: January 1, 2005\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * POS-020(D) Attachment to Proof of Personal Service—Civil (Documents Served) Effective: January 1, 2005\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nzz v1 comp.pdf (https://thomsonreuters.scene7.com/is/content/thomsonreutersPROD/278887_TOCpdf)\nciteturn1787search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 10 months ago; Crawled: 9 months ago; 2026] ... <tr><td>MC-013-INFO</td><td>26</td><td>Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment</td></tr>\nNUMERICAL LIST OF FORMS\n\n[Rev. Jan. 2026]\n\n<table id=\"e1\">\n<tr><th>Form No.</th><th>Year</th><th>Title</th></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-012*</td><td>26</td><td>Memorandum of Costs After Judgment, Acknowledgment of Credit, and Declaration of Accrued Interest</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-013-INFO</td><td>26</td><td>Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-020</td><td>87</td><td>Additional Page [to be attached to any form]</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-025</td><td>09</td><td>Attachment to Judicial Council Form</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-025 S</td><td>09</td><td>Attachment to Judicial Council Form (Spanish)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-030</td><td>06</td><td>Declaration [reverse of form MC-031]</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-031</td><td>05</td><td>Attached Declaration [reverse of form MC-030]</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-040</td><td>13</td><td>Notice of Change of Address or Other Contact Information</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-050*</td><td>09</td><td>Substitution of Attorney—Civil (Without Court Order)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MC-051*</td><td>07</td><td>Notice of Motion and Motion to Be Relieved as Counsel—Civil</td></tr>\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMC-013-INFO Information Sheet for Calculating Interst and Amount Owed on a Judgment (https://courts.ca.gov/sites/default/files/courts/default/2024-11/mc013info.pdf)\nciteturn1787search13 [wordlim: 200] Published: 11 months ago; Crawled: 10 months ago; To calculate the daily interest, use the following formula: ... January 1, 2026Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n**Step 2:** Count the total number of days that have passed since the court entered the final judgment up to the day of payment. Then calculate the amount of interest owed on the date of payment using the following formula.\n\n**Formula:** (Total number of days since judgment was entered) × (amount of interest per day, calculated in Step 1) = amount of interest owed on the date of payment.\n\n**Example:** A $5,000 judgment was entered on June 1 and the judgment debtor paid the judgment on September 8; 100 days from the entry of the judgment have passed.\n\n<table id=\"e2\">\n<tr>\n<th>5% Interest Rate</th>\n<th>10% Interest Rate</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>The daily interest is $0.69 (see above).<br>$0.69 per day × 100 days = $69 interest owed on the date of payment<br><br>The judgment debtor owes $69 in interest on the principal of $5,000 on the date of payment.</td>\n<td>The daily interest is $1.37 (see above).<br>$1.37 per day × 100 days = $137 interest owed on the date of payment.<br><br>The judgment debtor owes $137 in interest on the principal of $5,000 on the date of payment.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n**Step 3:** Add the amount of interest that has accrued to the amount of the judgment.\n\n<table id=\"e3\">\n<tr>\n<th>5% Interest Rate</th>\n<th>10% Interest Rate</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>$5,000 judgment + $69 interest = $5,069<br><br>The judgment debtor owes a total of $5,069 on the 100th day after the court entered judgment.</td>\n<td>$5,000 judgment amount + $137 interest = $5,137<br><br>The judgment debtor owes a total of $5,137 on the 100th day after the court entered judgment.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\nRev. January 1, 2026\n\nInformation Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment\n\nMC-013-INFO, Page 2 of 3--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nzz v1 comp.pdf (https://thomsonreuters.scene7.com/is/content/thomsonreuterscloudprod/278887_TOC)\nciteturn1787search14 [wordlim: 200] Published: 9 months ago; 2026] ... Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=11&query=DE-)\nciteturn1787search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today;   * MC-013-INFO Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment Effective: January 1, 2026\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMeeting Materials (https://courts.ca.gov/system/files/file/rules-20250904-materials.pdf)\nciteturn1787search15 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.1 years ago; Crawled: 1.1 years ago; # INFORMATION SHEET FOR CALCULATING INTEREST ... January 1, 2026, Optional Form ... Information Sheet for Calculating Interest\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSuperior Court of California (https://www.riverside.courts.ca.gov/system/files/2026-06/UD%20Judgment%20Default%20072026.1.pdf?cb=1782866154)\nciteturn1787search16 [wordlim: 200] Published: 16.5 years ago; Crawled: 3 months ago; Note for items 11–17: For more information on the amount recoverable by a judgment creditor, claiming costs after judgment, and calculating accrued interest, read *Information Sheet for Calculating Interest and Amount Owed on a Judgment* (form MC-013-INFO). ... July 1, 2026\n----------------------------------------